            "simpleExplanation": "从 (cóng) means \"from\" and 到 (dào) means \"to.\" Put them around two places to describe a route: 从这儿到银行 = \"from here to the bank.\" Add 很近 or 很远 at the end to say how far it is: 从这儿到银行很近 = \"From here to the bank is very close.\"",
